# Aider in Docker

Root cause: default Aider checks for updates and may run `pip install --upgrade`, then exit without applying edits (seen as empty stub tests + `tests_already_green`).

Always pass `--no-check-update` (and prefer `--yes-always`). Do not allow write to system site-packages in the container for upgrades.
